# Phase 1 for unofficial Browser Connector:
# - Adds active-chat snapshot endpoint to Browser Connector.
# - Adds sync-active-to-ERP endpoint that stores the currently open Facebook/Instagram/TikTok chat into Social Inbox.
# - Adds ERP ingest endpoint protected by a shared secret.
# - Does NOT remove official Meta Graph API connector.
# - Does NOT touch CDR/Elastix logic.

